{
  "title": "Juicy Gooey Turkish Pancetta Borek",
  "description": "A Mediterranean-inspired dish featuring fermented pancetta and gooey cheese in a crispy borek form, served in a stone-bowl-dolsot on an iron-teppan.",
  "cuisine": "Turkish",
